    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Manager Mail'] }}",
        "subject": "New Outgrower Onboarded — Action Required",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Manager Assigned'] }},</p>\n\n<p>A new outgrower has just been registered on the Hastom Outgrower Network and assigned to you. \nPlease initiate contact within 48 hours.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Outgrower Details</p>\nName: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Full name'] }}\n<br>Phone: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Phone number'] }}\n<br>Location: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Location }}\n<br>Farm Size: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Farm size'] }}\n<br>Crop Type:{{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Crop type'] }}\n<br>Onboarding Date:{{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Onboarding date'] }}\n\n<p><strong>Your Action</p>\nCall or message the grower within 48 hours to schedule an onboarding visit. Once the farm assessment is done, click the link <a href=\"https://onisemotobiloba.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/update_outgrower_status?email={{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.Email }}&name={{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json['Full name'] }}\"\nstyle=\"background-color:#2E7D32;color:white;padding:5x 10px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px;\">\n  ✅ Status Update\n</a> to change their status to active.</p>\n\n<p>If you have any issues reaching the grower, escalate to operations immediately.</p>\n\n<p>Regards,\n<br>Hastom Operations</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
